The area is outside the rule of Japan, and filled with sprawling grasslands, snowy tundras, and unexpected dangers.', 'https://www.igdb.com/games/ghost-of-yotei', '["PlayStation 5"]', NULL, 8.8, 0, 1.07, '2026-11-22 03:06:26', '2026-11-22 03:06:26')
