VALUES (NULL, NULL, 733, 'Grand Theft Auto: Vice City', 'Grand Theft Auto: Vice City', 'game', 2002, 'https://images.igdb.com/igdb/image/upload/t_cover_big/co2lbb.jpg', 'https://images.igdb.com/igdb/image/upload/t_1080p/arrb4.jpg', 'In the year 1986, Tommy Vercetti is heavily indebted to his mafia superiors after a drug deal gone awry, but his dreams of taking over Vice City (based on Miami) push him down a different path. Featuring a wide variety of vehicles and weapons, radio stations playing hit songs from the era and an intense atmosphere, GTA: Vice City is an open-world sandbox satire of ''80''s Miami.', 'https://www.igdb.com/games/grand-theft-auto-vice-city', '["Xbox", "PlayStation 3", "PC (Microsoft Windows)", "Mac", "PlayStation 2"]', NULL, 9.1, 0, 1.06, '2026-11-22 03:06:26', '2026-11-22 03:06:26')
