GoH is an RTS/ RTT that portrays WW2.
It offers a choice of instantly switchable top- down, third person and first person (for vehicles). SP, PvE, PvP. Dynamic campaigns are available for singleplayer and in co-op.', 'https://www.igdb.com/games/call-to-arms-gates-of-hell-ostfront', '["PC (Microsoft Windows)"]', NULL, NULL, 0, 6.02999999999999936e+00, '2026-11-19 20:56:22', '2026-11-22 03:06:26')
