VALUES (NULL, NULL, 529, 'Far Cry 3', 'Far Cry 3', 'game', 2012, 'https://images.igdb.com/igdb/image/upload/t_cover_big/co1vpd.jpg', 'https://images.igdb.com/igdb/image/upload/t_1080p/ar4k6a.jpg', 'Explore an island playground as stunningly beautiful as it is diverse – from mountain ranges to swampy grasslands and white sandy beaches. Fight your way through the island’s towns, temples, river ports and more.

Encounter a diverse and realistic cast of characters, including one of Far Cry’s most notorious villains: Vaas Montenegro. Dive into this deep and enriching story where morals are questionable and hope is all but abandoned.', 'https://www.igdb.com/games/far-cry-3', '["PlayStation 3", "PC (Microsoft Windows)", "Xbox 360"]', NULL, 8.6, 0, 6.01, '2026-11-21 13:07:40', '2026-11-22 03:06:26')
